---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="name-row">
    <img src="/avatar.svg" alt="Bằng Nguyễn" class="avatar" />
    <h1 class="name">Bằng Nguyễn</h1>
  </div>
  <p class="bio">
    Background in <strong>mobile, desktop, and web</strong>. Currently learning
    <strong>AI</strong> and applying <strong>Claude</strong> to developer tooling
    and automation.
  </p>
  <nav class="social-links">
    <a href="https://github.com/Bangkts" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a>
    <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok</a>
    <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>
    <a href="mailto:ngbangkts@gmail.com">Email</a>
  </nav>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.75rem 2.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .name-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid #e0dbd4;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .name {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .bio {
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    color: #2d2d2d;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .bio strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .social-links a {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .social-links a:hover { opacity: 0.65; }
</style>
